#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/processes.rs:84
msgid "Backup or file sync. Usually safe to pause."
msgstr "Varundamine või failide sünkroonimine. Tavaliselt on ohutu peatada."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/launch.rs:134
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/launch.rs:211
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Tasakaalustatud"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/scheduler_info.rs:39
msgid "Based on the famous CAKE networking algorithm, adapted for CPUs. It focuses on keeping task queues short and responsive under heavy system load."
msgstr "Põhineb kuulsal CAKE võrgualgoritmil, mis on kohandatud protsessoritele. See keskendub ülesannete järjekordade lühikese ja reageerivana hoidmisele suure süsteemikoormuse all."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/launch.rs:292
msgid "Basic is one line across the top, like the Steam Deck's level 2: frame rate, frame times, CPU and GPU load and power, memory and video memory. Full is a column, like its level 3: the GPU and the CPU each with load, temperature, clock and power, then memory, frame rate and frame times. Battery appears only on a laptop. A per-game MangoHud file (wine-<game>.conf) takes precedence, and a Flatpak launcher reads its own copy."
msgstr "Põhiline on üks rida üleval, nagu Steam Decki tase 2: kaadrisagedus, kaadriajad, protsessori ja GPU koormus ja võimsus, mälu ja videomälu. Täielik on veerg, nagu selle tase 3: GPU ja protsessor kumbki koormuse, temperatuuri, taktsageduse ja võimsusega, seejärel mälu, kaadrisagedus ja kaadriajad. Aku kuvatakse ainult sülearvutis. Mängupõhine MangoHudi fail (wine-<game>.conf) on ülimuslik ja Flatpaki käivitaja loeb oma koopiat."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/ai_graphics.rs:1009
msgid "Before Apply changes anything, every file it would replace is backed up and each copy is checked by its SHA-256. A manifest records every file placed, and each one is checked again after it is written; anything that fails is rolled back at once. The OptiScaler download is checked against the SHA-256 its release publishes. Restore Game Graphics takes out only files that are still exactly what was placed and puts every backup back; a file another program changed since is left alone. Nothing changes while the game runs."
msgstr "Enne kui Rakenda midagi muudab, varundatakse iga fail, mille see asendaks, ja iga koopiat kontrollitakse selle SHA-256 järgi. Manifest registreerib iga paigutatud faili ja igaüht kontrollitakse pärast kirjutamist uuesti; kõik, mis ebaõnnestub, võetakse kohe tagasi. OptiScaleri allalaadimist kontrollitakse selle väljalaskes avaldatud SHA-256 järgi. Taasta mängu graafika eemaldab ainult failid, mis on endiselt täpselt sellised, nagu need paigutati, ja paneb iga varukoopia tagasi; faili, mida mõni teine programm on vahepeal muutnud, ei puudutata. Mängu töötamise ajal ei muutu midagi."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/ai_graphics.rs:2284
msgid "Before the last update: %s"
msgstr "Enne viimast uuendust: %s"

#: data/com.biglinux.BiGameMode.desktop:3
#: data/com.biglinux.BiGameMode.metainfo.xml:5
msgid "Big Game Mode"
msgstr "Big Game Mode"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/optimization.rs:86
msgid "Big Game Mode and falcond leave the driver's current preference alone."
msgstr "Big Game Mode ja falcond jätavad draiveri praeguse eelistuse puutumata."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/extras.rs:257
msgid "Big Game Mode asks it to quit, as closing its window would (SIGTERM). Anything you have not saved in it may be lost. A program that ignores the request keeps running: nothing forces it."
msgstr "Big Game Mode palub sellel lõpetada, nagu selle akna sulgemine teeks (SIGTERM). Kõik, mida te selles salvestanud pole, võib kaduda. Programm, mis palvet eirab, töötab edasi: miski ei sunni seda."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/game_fields.rs:98
msgid "Big Game Mode cannot start this game, and its launcher takes no launch settings from Big Game Mode: it gets Tuning's, Wine FSR and vkBasalt from the session environment."
msgstr "Big Game Mode ei saa seda mängu käivitada ja selle käivitaja ei võta Big Game Mode'ilt käivitusseadeid: see saab Häälestuse seaded, Wine FSR-i ja vkBasalti seansi keskkonnast."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/graphics/mod.rs:267
#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/graphics/transaction.rs:798
msgid "Big Game Mode has installed nothing in %s"
msgstr "Big Game Mode ei ole mängule %s midagi paigaldanud"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/profile_offer.rs:227
msgid "Big Game Mode has no profile for this game yet. Create one tuned for this machine?"
msgstr "Big Game Mode'il pole sellele mängule veel profiili. Kas luua see masina jaoks häälestatud profiil?"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/profile_offer.rs:487
msgid "Big Game Mode has no profile for this game yet. This is the profile it would create, and why each value was chosen."
msgstr "Big Game Mode'il pole sellele mängule veel profiili. See on profiil, mille see looks, ja põhjused, miks iga väärtus valiti."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/health.rs:861
#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/health.rs:867
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/logs.rs:50
msgid "Big Game Mode helper"
msgstr "Big Game Mode'i abiprogramm"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/ai_graphics.rs:387
msgid "Big Game Mode installed OptiScaler in this game, and with the choice below it is not needed. Restore puts the game's own files back."
msgstr "Big Game Mode paigaldas sellesse mängu OptiScaleri ja allpool tehtud valikuga pole seda vaja. Taastamine paneb mängu enda failid tagasi."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/graphics/mod.rs:273
msgid "Big Game Mode installed into %s, which is not this game's folder (%s): the game was moved without its files, or the record is another game's. Nothing was changed"
msgstr "Big Game Mode paigaldas asukohta %s, mis pole selle mängu kaust (%s): mäng teisaldati ilma oma failideta või kirje kuulub teisele mängule. Midagi ei muudetud"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/app.rs:688
msgid "Big Game Mode is BigLinux's gaming hub. With one button, Turbo, games run with the right performance profile, applied by falcond when they open and undone when they close. The app shows what is really in force, measures whether a change helped, and takes care of what happens inside the game, such as upscaling and frame generation, always with a full backup and undo."
msgstr "Big Game Mode on BigLinuxi mängukeskus. Ühe nupuga, Turboga, töötavad mängud õige jõudlusprofiiliga, mille falcond rakendab nende avamisel ja võtab tagasi nende sulgemisel. Rakendus näitab, mis tegelikult kehtib, mõõdab, kas muudatus aitas, ja hoolitseb selle eest, mis toimub mängu sees, näiteks ülesskaleerimise ja kaadrite genereerimise eest, alati täieliku varukoopia ja tagasivõtmisega."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/app.rs:113
msgid "Big Game Mode is in the middle of something it has to finish, such as a measurement or switching Turbo. Quitting now could leave a change applied."
msgstr "Big Game Mode on keset midagi, mis tuleb lõpetada, näiteks mõõtmist või Turbo lülitamist. Praegu väljumine võib jätta muudatuse rakendatuks."

#: data/com.biglinux.BiGameMode.metainfo.xml:12
msgid "Big Game Mode is the gaming centre of BigLinux. Turbo switches falcond on, so every game gets its performance profile, applied when it starts and undone when it closes. Big Game Mode shows what is really in effect, measures whether a change helped, and manages upscaling and frame generation inside games, with full backup and undo."
msgstr "Big Game Mode on BigLinuxi mängukeskus. Turbo lülitab falcondi sisse, nii et iga mäng saab oma jõudlusprofiili, mis rakendatakse mängu käivitumisel ja tühistatakse selle sulgumisel. Big Game Mode näitab, mis tegelikult kehtib, mõõdab, kas muudatus aitas, ning haldab mängusisest ülesskaleerimist ja kaadrite genereerimist täieliku varunduse ja tagasivõtmisega."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/processes.rs:96
msgid "Big Game Mode itself. Details reads the system every second while it is on screen; minimised, it costs almost nothing."
msgstr "Big Game Mode ise. Leht Üksikasjad loeb süsteemi iga sekund, kui see on ekraanil; minimeerituna ei kuluta see peaaegu midagi."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/profile_wizard.rs:189
msgid "Big Game Mode looks at the game and your graphics card and shows what it would do. Nothing changes until you press Apply."
msgstr "Big Game Mode vaatab mängu ja teie graafikakaarti ning näitab, mida see teeks. Midagi ei muutu enne, kui vajutate Rakenda."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/settings.rs:229
msgid "Big Game Mode manages falcond again"
msgstr "Big Game Mode haldab taas falcondi"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/ai_graphics.rs:1632
msgid "Big Game Mode picks for this game and this graphics card: the game's own upscaler when it is already the best, or OptiScaler where it adds something the game lacks (FSR 4 on RDNA 4 cards) or where Big Game Mode measured it faster. The card at the top says what that is here."
msgstr "Big Game Mode valib selle mängu ja selle graafikakaardi jaoks: mängu enda ülesskaleerija, kui see on juba parim, või OptiScaleri, kui see lisab midagi, mis mängul puudub (FSR 4 RDNA 4 kaartidel), või kui Big Game Mode mõõtis selle kiiremaks. Ülemine kaart ütleb, mis see siin on."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/ai_graphics.rs:516
msgid "Big Game Mode picks the fewest components that give the best result for this game on this GPU. If the game's own upscaler is already the best, nothing is installed. OptiScaler is used where it adds something the game lacks — FSR 4 on RDNA 4 graphics cards — or where Big Game Mode's game list records it as faster for that game, measured on its test machines. DLSS is offered only on NVIDIA RTX cards. Frame generation is never switched on by itself: it raises the presented frame rate, not the rendered one, and adds latency. Games with anti-cheat get no injection at all."
msgstr "Big Game Mode valib kõige vähem komponente, mis annavad selle mängu jaoks sellel GPU-l parima tulemuse. Kui mängu enda ülesskaleerija on juba parim, ei paigaldata midagi. OptiScalerit kasutatakse seal, kus see lisab midagi, mis mängul puudub — FSR 4 RDNA 4 graafikakaartidel —, või kus Big Game Mode'i mänguloend märgib selle selle mängu jaoks kiiremaks, mõõdetuna selle testmasinatel. DLSS-i pakutakse ainult NVIDIA RTX kaartidel. Kaadrite genereerimist ei lülitata kunagi iseenesest sisse: see tõstab kuvatavat kaadrisagedust, mitte renderdatavat, ja lisab latentsust. Petmisvastase kaitsega mängudesse ei süstita üldse midagi."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/dns.rs:175
msgid "Big Game Mode set %s; the previous settings are kept"
msgstr "Big Game Mode seadis %s; eelmised seaded on alles hoitud"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/measure_dialog.rs:72
msgid "Big Game Mode would change nothing on this machine, so %t would be measured against itself. The game's profile is still applied by falcond whenever it runs."
msgstr "Big Game Mode ei muudaks selles masinas midagi, seega mõõdetaks %t iseenda vastu. falcond rakendab mängu profiili siiski alati, kui mäng töötab."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/graphics/report.rs:410
msgid "Big Game Mode's game list names the API this game renders with by default"
msgstr "Big Game Mode'i mänguloend nimetab API, millega see mäng vaikimisi renderdab"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/profiles.rs:1032
msgid "Big Game Mode's own choices for this game — its launch settings, MangoHud and AI Graphics — kept in your configuration, with no password. What Big Game Mode wrote into Steam's launch options or Heroic's settings is recorded there, so it changes or removes exactly that."
msgstr "Big Game Mode'i enda valikud selle mängu jaoks — selle käivitusseaded, MangoHud ja AI-graafika — hoitakse teie seadistuses, ilma paroolita. Sinna on kirja pandud, mida Big Game Mode Steami käivitusvalikutesse või Heroicu seadetesse kirjutas, nii et see muudab või eemaldab täpselt selle."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/welcome.rs:129
msgid "BigLinux's game mode: Turbo in one click, a profile for every game, and a page that shows, with evidence, what is really in force."
msgstr "BigLinuxi mängurežiim: Turbo ühe klõpsuga, profiil igale mängule ja leht, mis näitab tõenditega, mis tegelikult kehtib."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/ai_graphics.rs:1089
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/ai_graphics.rs:192
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/ai_graphics.rs:552
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/ai_graphics.rs:892
