msgstr "Töötav kernel on ehitatud ilma sched_ext'ita. Vaja on sellega kernelit (BigLinuxi vaikimisi)."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/performance.rs:334
msgid "The running kernel was built without sched_ext. Nothing to install; a kernel with sched_ext (the default BigLinux kernel has it) is needed."
msgstr "Töötav kernel on ehitatud ilma sched_ext'ita. Pole midagi paigaldada; vaja on sched_ext'iga kernelit (BigLinuxi vaikekernelil see on)."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/measure_dialog.rs:270
msgid "The runs produced no usable frametimes."
msgstr "Käivitused ei andnud kasutatavaid kaadriaegu."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/tuning.rs:742
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/game_fields.rs:551
