msgstr "Samad jaotised nagu Häälestuses (Jõudlus, Ekraan, Pildikvaliteet, Kaadrite genereerimine, Jälgimine, Täpsem), ainult selle mängu jaoks. falcond rakendab seda mängu töötamise ajal."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/optimization.rs:51
msgid "The scheduler as its authors tuned it. The safe choice when in doubt."
msgstr "Ajastaja nii, nagu selle autorid selle häälestasid. Turvaline valik kahtluse korral."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/problems.rs:237
msgid "The scheduler the profile asked for is not the one running. See the Performance row for what falcond and the kernel report."
msgstr "Profiili taotletud ajastaja pole see, mis töötab. Vaadake realt Jõudlus, mida falcond ja kernel teatavad."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/performance.rs:228
msgid "The service failed"
msgstr "Teenus ebaõnnestus"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/problems.rs:215
msgid "The service runs but its status file cannot be read; nothing it does can be verified."
msgstr "Teenus töötab, kuid selle olekufaili ei saa lugeda; midagi, mida see teeb, ei saa kontrollida."

