msgstr "Need seatakse väljaspool AI-graafikat: mängu enda menüüs või selle profiilis."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/tuning.rs:458
msgid "These games' launch options already run a Gamescope of their own, so Big Game Mode's was not added: %s"
msgstr "Nende mängude käivitusvalikud käitavad juba oma Gamescope'i, seega Big Game Mode'i oma ei lisatud: %s"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/turbo_presets.rs:72
msgid "This GPU has no FSR 4, so that part is left out."
msgstr "Sellel GPU-l pole FSR 4-t, seega see osa jäetakse välja."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/dns.rs:226
msgid "This changes the system's network settings for the connection “%s”: %s becomes its first DNS server, and the servers handed out automatically are no longer used. The current settings are saved first; “Restore previous” under Details › Network puts them back."
msgstr "See muudab süsteemi võrguseadeid ühenduse „%s” jaoks: %s saab selle esimeseks DNS-serveriks ja automaatselt jagatud servereid enam ei kasutata. Praegused seaded salvestatakse esmalt; „Taasta eelmine” jaotises Üksikasjad › Võrk paneb need tagasi."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/dns.rs:51
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/dns.rs:61
msgid "This computer's DNS"
msgstr "Selle arvuti DNS"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/tuning.rs:1148
msgid "This file does not exist"
msgstr "Seda faili pole olemas"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/ai_graphics.rs:1147
msgid "This game and GPU meet what DLSS-NR-on-AMD asks for, and it is not installed beside the game. It is optional: install it yourself from its official page if you want to try it, then press Check Again."
msgstr "See mäng ja GPU vastavad DLSS-NR-on-AMD nõuetele ja see pole mängu kõrvale paigaldatud. See on valikuline: kui soovite seda proovida, paigaldage see ise selle ametlikult lehelt, seejärel vajutage nuppu Kontrolli uuesti."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/pipeline.rs:416
msgid "This game has AI Graphics installed: Wine FSR is turned off for its launch from Big Game Mode, so two upscalers never run in series."
msgstr "Sellele mängule on paigaldatud AI-graafika: Wine FSR lülitatakse selle Big Game Mode'ist käivitamisel välja, nii et kaks ülesskaleerijat ei tööta kunagi järjestikku."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/game_fields.rs:1285
msgid "This game's setting is kept, and applies when lsfg-vk is turned on in Tuning."
msgstr "Selle mängu seade jäetakse alles ja see rakendub, kui lsfg-vk jaotises Häälestus sisse lülitatakse."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/profiles.rs:1026
msgid "This game's settings"
msgstr "Selle mängu seaded"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/performance.rs:300
msgid "This kernel has no sched-ext"
msgstr "Sellel kernelil pole sched-ext'i"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/network.rs:389
msgid "This measures how quickly each resolver answers a lookup. It does not affect the round-trip time of match traffic once a game has connected."
msgstr "See mõõdab, kui kiiresti iga lahendaja päringule vastab. See ei mõjuta mänguliikluse edasi-tagasi aega, kui mäng on juba ühendunud."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/performance.rs:388
msgid "This needs an AMD X3D processor (5800X3D, 7800X3D, 9800X3D…). Nothing to do: it is a hardware feature, not a fault."
msgstr "See vajab AMD X3D protsessorit (5800X3D, 7800X3D, 9800X3D…). Pole midagi teha: see on riistvara omadus, mitte viga."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/optimization.rs:77
msgid "Throughput for long batch work, not for games. Listed because falcond accepts it."
msgstr "Läbilaskevõime pikaajaliseks pakktööks, mitte mängudeks. Loetletud, sest falcond aktsepteerib seda."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/telemetry.rs:151
msgid "Timeout"
msgstr "Aegumine"

