#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/settings.rs:348
msgid "Turbo Mode"
msgstr "Turbo-režiim"

#: data/com.biglinux.BiGameMode.metainfo.xml:100
msgid "Turbo as the master switch over falcond, per-game profiles offered when an unknown game starts, AI Graphics with OptiScaler (backup, repair and restore), a benchmark lab with A/B verdicts, diagnostics and a unified log view."
msgstr "Turbo kui peamine lüliti falcondi üle, mängupõhised profiilid, mida pakutakse tundmatu mängu käivitumisel, AI-graafika OptiScaleriga (varundamine, parandamine ja taastamine), jõudlustesti labor A/B-otsustega, diagnostika ja ühtne logivaade."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/profiles.rs:952
msgid "Turbo could not be switched on; the game starts without its profile. See Home."
msgstr "Turbot ei õnnestunud sisse lülitada; mäng käivitub ilma oma profiilita. Vaadake avalehte."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/welcome.rs:55
msgid "Turbo in one click"
msgstr "Turbo ühe klõpsuga"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/performance.rs:109
msgid "Turbo is falcond's service, as systemd reports it: on means enabled and running, off means stopped. Nothing is claimed that systemd does not confirm."
msgstr "Turbo on falcondi teenus, nagu systemd sellest teatab: sees tähendab lubatud ja töötav, väljas tähendab peatatud. Midagi, mida systemd ei kinnita, ei väideta."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/overview.rs:142
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/home.rs:1099
msgid "Turbo is off"
msgstr "Turbo on väljas"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/overview.rs:148
msgid "Turbo is on. The next game gets its profile as it starts."
msgstr "Turbo on sees. Järgmine mäng saab oma profiili käivitumisel."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/tray.rs:169
msgid "Turbo mode"
msgstr "Turbo režiim"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/tray.rs:88
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/booster_button.rs:59
msgid "Turbo mode activated"
msgstr "Turbo-režiim sees"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/tray.rs:91
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/booster_button.rs:57
msgid "Turbo mode inactive"
msgstr "Turbo-režiim väljas"

#: data/com.biglinux.BiGameMode.metainfo.xml:51
msgid "Turbo no longer switches itself off a few seconds after it starts on processors the installed falcond cannot run on"
msgstr "Turbo ei lülitu enam paar sekundit pärast käivitumist ise välja protsessoritel, millel paigaldatud falcond töötada ei saa"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/turbo.rs:579
#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/turbo.rs:740
#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/turbo.rs:795
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/tray.rs:189
msgid "Turbo preset"
msgstr "Turbo eelseade"

#: data/com.biglinux.BiGameMode.metainfo.xml:90
msgid "Turbo presets chosen before switching it on (More FPS, Locked 60 FPS, Enhanced graphics), a redrawn Home with a power button, live readings and the running game's features as coloured flags; Tuning, game profiles and the profile wizard on one model, with every conflict asked; Gamescope and Wine FSR reach Steam games through their launch options; launchers are no longer taken for the game; Details tells when falcond does not apply a game's profile, and why."
msgstr "Turbo eelseaded, mis valitakse enne selle sisselülitamist (Rohkem FPS-i, Püsiv 60 FPS, Parem graafika), ümber joonistatud Avaleht toitenupuga, reaalajas näidud ja töötava mängu funktsioonid värviliste siltidena; Häälestus, mänguprofiilid ja profiilinõustaja ühel mudelil, kusjuures iga konflikti korral küsitakse; Gamescope ja Wine FSR jõuavad Steami mängudeni nende käivitusvalikute kaudu; käivitajaid ei peeta enam mänguks; Üksikasjad ütleb, millal falcond mängu profiili ei rakenda, ja miks."

#: data/com.biglinux.BiGameMode.metainfo.xml:75
msgid "Turbo rolls back cleanly when falcond fails to start, and presets leave nothing behind when switched off"
msgstr "Turbo võetakse puhtalt tagasi, kui falcond ei käivitu, ja eelseaded ei jäta väljalülitamisel midagi maha"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/report.rs:236
msgid "Turbo turned off"
msgstr "Turbo lülitati välja"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/settings.rs:125
msgid "Turbo turns falcond's service on and off. The first time it did, it recorded whether falcond was enabled and running. Handing back restores exactly that and leaves falcond alone. Taking control back records falcond's state as it is then — so a later hand-back restores that — and makes it follow Turbo again: kept running and enabled if it runs, kept stopped and disabled if it does not. Switching Turbo on or off also takes control back."
msgstr "Turbo lülitab falcondi teenuse sisse ja välja. Esimesel korral salvestas see, kas falcond oli lubatud ja töötas. Tagasiandmine taastab täpselt selle ja jätab falcondi rahule. Juhtimise tagasivõtmine salvestab falcondi tolle hetke oleku — nii et hilisem tagasiandmine taastab selle — ja paneb selle taas Turbot järgima: töötav ja lubatud, kui see töötab, peatatud ja keelatud, kui mitte. Turbo sisse- või väljalülitamine võtab samuti juhtimise tagasi."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/overview.rs:208
msgid "Turbo's state cannot be read"
msgstr "Turbo olekut ei saa lugeda"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/home.rs:311
msgid "Turbo's state cannot be read: systemd did not answer"
msgstr "Turbo olekut ei saa lugeda: systemd ei vastanud"

#: data/com.biglinux.BiGameMode.metainfo.xml:14
msgid "Turbo: one switch for per-game optimization through falcond"
msgstr "Turbo: üks lüliti mängupõhiseks optimeerimiseks falcondi kaudu"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/performance.rs:121
msgid "Turn Turbo off and on again at Home to restart it. Logs show why it failed."
msgstr "Taaskäivitamiseks lülitage Turbo avalehel välja ja uuesti sisse. Logid näitavad, miks see ebaõnnestus."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/performance.rs:125
msgid "Turn Turbo on at Home. Until then no profile, scheduler or power profile is applied for a game."
msgstr "Lülitage Turbo avalehel sisse. Seni ei rakendata mängule ühtegi profiili, ajastajat ega toiteprofiili."

#: data/com.biglinux.BiGameMode.policy:39
msgid "Turn Turbo on or off"
msgstr "Turbo sisse- või väljalülitamine"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/health.rs:646
msgid "Turn Turbo on — or off and on again if it is already on — to switch falcond to its desktop profiles"
msgstr "Lülitage Turbo sisse — või kui see on juba sees, välja ja uuesti sisse —, et lülitada falcond selle lauaarvuti profiilidele"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/ai_graphics.rs:2018
msgid "Turn Wine FSR off for this game"
msgstr "Lülita Wine FSR selle mängu jaoks välja"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/tray.rs:85
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/booster_button.rs:61
msgid "Turning Off"
msgstr "Väljalülitamine"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/tray.rs:84
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/booster_button.rs:58
msgid "Turning On"
msgstr "Sisselülitamine"

#: data/com.biglinux.BiGameMode.metainfo.xml:52
msgid "Turning Turbo off or changing the preset reaches Steam and Heroic once they are closed, and deleting a profile takes its launch options out of Steam, Heroic and Lutris"
msgstr "Turbo väljalülitamine või eelseade vahetamine jõuab Steami ja Heroicuni niipea, kui need on suletud, ning profiili kustutamine eemaldab selle käivitusvalikud Steamist, Heroicust ja Lutrisest"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/ai_graphics.rs:1760
#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/game_fields.rs:1259
